<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Unit 2 "In Fashion" — Interactive Practice</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/manrope@latest/latin-400-normal.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/manrope@latest/latin-600-normal.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/manrope@latest/latin-800-normal.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/space-grotesk@latest/latin-700-normal.css">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f5f7fc; --text:#1b2340; --muted:#5b6486;
  --card:#ffffff; --stroke:#e6eaf5; --stroke2:#dfe5f2;
  --ok:#10b981; --warn:#f59e0b; --err:#ef4444;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  font-family:'Manrope',system-ui,sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text);
  min-height:100vh; padding:28px 16px 80px; overflow-x:hidden;
}
body::before,body::after{
  content:''; position:fixed; border-radius:50%; filter:blur(110px); z-index:-1;
}
body::before{width:520px;height:520px;background:rgba(236,72,153,.12);top:-160px;left:-140px}
body::after{width:460px;height:460px;background:rgba(99,102,241,.12);bottom:-160px;right:-120px}

.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto}

/* ---------- HERO ---------- */
.hero{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.8); border:1px solid var(--stroke); border-radius:28px;
  padding:40px 36px; backdrop-filter:blur(20px); position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 24px 60px -34px rgba(28,35,64,.3);
}
.hero h1{
  font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.6rem); letter-spacing:-.5px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,#db2777,#4f46e5,#0d9488);
  -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; color:transparent;
}
.hero p.sub{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px;font-size:1.02rem}
.hero-row{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:26px}
.field label{display:block;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:700}
.inp{
  background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--stroke2); border-radius:14px;
  padding:12px 16px; color:var(--text); font:inherit; width:100%; transition:.2s;
}
.inp:focus{outline:none;border-color:#ec4899;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(236,72,153,.14)}
.progress-wrap{flex:1;min-width:220px}
.pbar{height:10px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--stroke);overflow:hidden}
.pfill{
  height:100%;width:0%;border-radius:99px;transition:width .6s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,#10b981,#f59e0b,#f97316,#ec4899);
}
.ptext{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-weight:600}

/* ---------- TABS ---------- */
.tabs{
  display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:26px 0;padding:8px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.85);border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:20px;backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
  position:sticky;top:12px;z-index:50;box-shadow:0 14px 40px -26px rgba(28,35,64,.35);
}
.tab{
  flex:1;min-width:130px;border:0;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 10px;cursor:pointer;
  background:transparent;color:var(--muted);font:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;transition:.25s;
}
.tab:hover{background:#eef1f9;color:var(--text)}
.tab.active{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ta),var(--tb));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 26px -10px var(--ta)}
.tab .tick{display:none;font-size:.8rem}
.tab.done .tick{display:inline}

/* ---------- BLOCKS & CARDS ---------- */
.block{display:none}
.block.active{display:block}
.block-head{margin:8px 4px 22px}
.block-head h2{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:1.6rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.block-head .dot{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--acc);box-shadow:0 0 16px var(--acc)}
.block-head p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}

.card{
  --acc:#6366f1; --acc2:#4f46e5;
  background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--stroke); border-radius:22px;
  padding:26px; margin-bottom:22px; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 14px 44px -28px rgba(28,35,64,.3);
  animation:rise .5s both;
}
.card::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:4px;background:linear-gradient(var(--acc),var(--acc2))}
.card[data-a="g"]{--acc:#10b981;--acc2:#0d9488}
.card[data-a="y"]{--acc:#f59e0b;--acc2:#d97706}
.card[data-a="o"]{--acc:#f97316;--acc2:#ef4444}
.card[data-a="p"]{--acc:#ec4899;--acc2:#a855f7}
.card[data-a="i"]{--acc:#6366f1;--acc2:#4f46e5}
@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

.card-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px}
.exnum{
  font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--acc),var(--acc2));color:#fff;
  padding:6px 12px;border-radius:10px;
}
.card-top h3{font-size:1.15rem}
.badge{
  margin-left:auto;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800;
  padding:5px 10px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--stroke2);color:var(--muted);
}
.badge.auto{color:#0e7490;border-color:rgba(14,116,144,.35);background:rgba(14,116,144,.06)}
.badge.write{color:#a21caf;border-color:rgba(162,28,175,.3);background:rgba(162,28,175,.06)}
.badge.drag{color:#d97706;border-color:rgba(217,119,6,.35);background:rgba(217,119,6,.06)}

.instr{
  background:#f7f9fe;border:1px dashed var(--stroke2);border-radius:14px;
  padding:12px 16px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:18px;
}
.instr b{color:var(--text)}

/* matching */
.mgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.mitem{
  background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--stroke2);border-radius:14px;
  padding:12px 14px;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s;font-size:.95rem;
}
.mitem:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--acc);box-shadow:0 8px 20px -14px rgba(28,35,64,.4)}
.mitem.sel{background:var(--acc);color:#fff;border-color:transparent;font-weight:700}
.mitem.paired{border-color:var(--acc);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--acc)}
.mitem.ok{border-color:var(--ok);background:#ecfdf5;color:#065f46}
.mitem.bad{border-color:var(--err);background:#fef2f2;color:#991b1b}

/* inputs */
.line{background:#f8fafd;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:.98rem;line-height:1.7}
.wide{width:100%;margin-top:8px}
textarea.inp{min-height:110px;resize:vertical;line-height:1.6}

/* drag and drop */
.word-bank{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px dashed #fde68a;border-radius:16px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:20px;min-height:70px;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.drag-word{
  padding:8px 16px;border-radius:99px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #fcd34d;color:#92400e;
  cursor:grab;font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;user-select:none;transition:.2s;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
}
.drag-word:active{cursor:grabbing;transform:scale(1.05)}
.drag-word.placed{opacity:.3;pointer-events:none}
.drop-text{line-height:2.2;font-size:1.05rem;background:#f8fafd;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:14px;padding:20px}
.drop-zone{
  display:inline-block;min-width:120px;height:32px;border-bottom:2px dashed var(--acc);
  border-radius:6px;vertical-align:middle;margin:0 4px;transition:.2s;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5);
}
.drop-zone.hover{background:rgba(236,72,153,.1);border-color:#ec4899}
.drop-zone.filled{border-bottom-style:solid;background:#fff;color:var(--text);font-weight:600;padding:0 12px;line-height:30px;cursor:pointer}
.drop-zone.ok{border-color:var(--ok);background:#ecfdf5;color:#065f46}
.drop-zone.bad{border-color:var(--err);background:#fef2f2;color:#991b1b}

/* chips / sorting */
.bank{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;background:#f8fafd;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:16px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:16px;min-height:64px}
.chip{
  padding:9px 18px;border-radius:99px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--stroke2);
  cursor:pointer;user-select:none;transition:.2s;font-weight:600;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--text);
}
.chip:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--acc)}
.chip.sel{background:var(--acc);color:#fff;border-color:transparent;box-shadow:0 8px 20px -8px var(--acc)}
.cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.dropcol{border:2px dashed #d7ddec;border-radius:18px;padding:16px;min-height:200px;background:#fbfcfe;transition:.2s}
.dropcol.hot{border-color:var(--acc);background:#f4f7ff}
.dropcol h4{text-align:center;padding:10px;border-radius:12px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:.9rem}
.dropcol.c1 h4{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#0284c7)}
.dropcol.c2 h4{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#7c3aed)}
.dropcol.c3 h4{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f43f5e,#e11d48)}
.drop{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;justify-content:center}

/* mc */
.mcq{background:#f8fafd;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:12px}
.opts{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}
.opt{
  padding:8px 18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--stroke2);background:#fff;
  cursor:pointer;transition:.2s;font-weight:600;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--text);
}
.opt:hover{border-color:var(--acc)}
.opt.sel{background:var(--acc);color:#fff;border-color:transparent}
.opt.ok{border-color:var(--ok);background:#ecfdf5;color:#065f46}
.opt.bad{border-color:var(--err);background:#fef2f2;color:#991b1b}

/* buttons */
.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}
.btn{
  border:0;border-radius:14px;padding:12px 24px;font:inherit;font-weight:800;font-size:.93rem;
  cursor:pointer;transition:.25s;letter-spacing:.02em;
}
.btn.primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--acc),var(--acc2));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 26px -10px var(--acc)}
.btn.primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);filter:brightness(1.06)}
.btn.primary:active{transform:scale(.97)}
.btn.ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--stroke2)}
.btn.ghost:hover{background:#f2f5fb}

/* feedback */
.fb{display:none;margin-top:14px;padding:13px 16px;border-radius:14px;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:600}
.fb.show{display:block;animation:rise .3s}
.fb.ok{background:#ecfdf5;border:1px solid #a7f3d0;color:#065f46}
.fb.warn{background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e}
.fb.err{background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;color:#991b1b}

/* extras */
.example{background:#fdf2f8;border:1px solid #fbcfe8;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7;color:#9d174d}
.example b{color:#be185d}
.pq{background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;border-radius:16px;padding:18px;margin-top:18px}
.pq h4{margin-bottom:12px;color:#92400e}
.pq label{display:block;font-size:.92rem;margin:10px 0 6px;color:var(--text)}
.hidden{display:none}

/* image task */
.img-placeholder{
  width:100%;height:500px;border:3px dashed #cbd5e1;border-radius:20px;background:#f1f5f9;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;color:#64748b;
  font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:20px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;
}
.img-placeholder img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;position:absolute;top:0;left:0}
.word-box-inline{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;background:#f1f5f9;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
.word-box-inline span{background:#fff;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--stroke2)}

/* report */
.checklist{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:18px 0}
.ck{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:11px 14px;border-radius:12px;
  background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--stroke);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);
}
.ck .box{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px;border:2px solid var(--stroke2);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.75rem;flex:none}
.ck.done{color:#065f46;border-color:#a7f3d0;background:#ecfdf5}
.ck.done .box{background:var(--ok);border-color:var(--ok);color:#fff}
#reportPanel{display:none;margin-top:20px}
#reportPanel.show{display:block;animation:rise .4s}
#reportPre{
  white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f6f8fc;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:16px;
  padding:20px;font-family:ui-monospace,'Cascadia Mono',Consolas,monospace;font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.65;color:#334155;
}

@media(max-width:760px){
  .mgrid,.cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .tabs{position:static}
  .hero{padding:28px 22px}
}
@media print{
  body{background:#fff;color:#000;padding:0}
  body::before,body::after,.hero,.tabs,.block:not(#b5),.actions,.checklist,.fb{display:none!important}
  #reportPanel{display:block!important}
  #reportPre{background:#fff;color:#000;border:1px solid #999}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <header class="hero">
    <h1>Unit 2 · In Fashion</h1>
    <p class="sub">Interactive Practice · Level A2+ / B1 · Vocabulary → Past Simple → Adverbs → Final Challenge</p>
    <div class="hero-row">
      <div class="field" style="flex:1;min-width:220px">
        <label for="studentName">Student name</label>
        <input class="inp" id="studentName" placeholder="Type your name…">
      </div>
      <div class="progress-wrap">
        <div class="pbar"><div class="pfill" id="progFill"></div></div>
        <div class="ptext" id="progText">0 / 11 tasks completed</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- TABS -->
  <nav class="tabs">
    <button class="tab active" data-t="b1" style="--ta:#10b981;--tb:#0d9488">🟢 Vocabulary <span class="tick">✓</span></button>
    <button class="tab" data-t="b2" style="--ta:#f59e0b;--tb:#d97706">🟡 Past Simple <span class="tick">✓</span></button>
    <button class="tab" data-t="b3" style="--ta:#f97316;--tb:#ef4444">🟠 Adverbs <span class="tick">✓</span></button>
    <button class="tab" data-t="b4" style="--ta:#ec4899;--tb:#a855f7">🔴 Challenge <span class="tick">✓</span></button>
    <button class="tab" data-t="b5" style="--ta:#6366f1;--tb:#4f46e5">📊 Report <span class="tick">✓</span></button>
  </nav>

  <!-- ============ BLOCK 1 ============ -->
  <section class="block active" id="b1">
    <div class="block-head" style="--acc:#10b981">
      <h2><span class="dot"></span>Block 1 · Vocabulary</h2>
      <p>Goal: use advanced B1 vocabulary to describe clothes, styles, and fashion habits.</p>
    </div>

    <article class="card" data-a="g">
      <div class="card-top"><span class="exnum">EX 1.1</span><h3>Match the Meaning</h3><span class="badge auto">auto-check</span></div>
      <p class="instr"><b>Instructions:</b> click a word on the left, then click its definition on the right. These 12 words will help you in the next exercises!</p>
      <div class="mgrid">
        <div id="mLeft">
          <div class="mitem" data-k="1">1. loose-fitting</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="2">2. smart (clothes)</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="3">3. trendy</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="4">4. second-hand</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="5">5. well-dressed</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="6">6. casual</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="7">7. to match</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="8">8. to borrow</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="9">9. fashionable</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="10">10. skinny (jeans)</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="11">11. brand new</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="12">12. uncomfortable</div>
        </div>
        <div id="mRight">
          <div class="mitem" data-k="6">A. relaxed and comfortable, not formal</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="1">B. not tight, comfortable and a bit baggy</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="11">C. completely new, never used before</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="4">D. not new, previously owned by someone else</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="7">E. to look good together (e.g., colours or styles)</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="2">F. formal and elegant, suitable for work or a party</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="12">G. making you feel physical pain or annoyance</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="3">H. very fashionable at the moment</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="8">I. to take and use something with permission, planning to return it</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="10">J. very tight and narrow</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="5">K. wearing stylish and appropriate clothes</div>
          <div class="mitem" data-k="9">L. popular at a particular time</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="actions">
        <button class="btn primary" id="check11">Check answers</button>
        <button class="btn ghost" id="reset11">Reset</button>
      </div>
      <div class="fb" id="fb11"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="card" data-a="g">
      <div class="card-top"><span class="exnum">EX 1.2</span><h3>Vocabulary Upgrade</h3><span class="badge write">writing</span></div>
      <p class="instr"><b>Instructions:</b> rewrite the A2 sentences below to sound more advanced (B1). <b>No hints this time!</b> Go back to <b>Exercise 1.1</b>, find the best B1 word or phrase for each sentence and use it in your new version. Your answers are saved for the teacher's report.</p>
      <div class="example"><b>Example:</b> I like clothes that are not tight. → <i>I prefer loose-fitting clothes.</i></div>
      <div class="line">1. My sister always wears beautiful and formal clothes to work.
        <input class="inp wide" id="o12a" data-open placeholder="Your B1 sentence…"></div>
      <div class="line">2. I don't like buying old clothes that other people wore.
        <input class="inp wide" id="o12b" data-open placeholder="Your B1 sentence…"></div>
      <div class="line">3. These shoes hurt my feet, they are not nice to wear.
        <input class="inp wide" id="o12c" data-open placeholder="Your B1 sentence…"></div>
      <div class="line">4. My blue shirt looks good with my black trousers.
        <input class="inp wide" id="o12d" data-open placeholder="Your B1 sentence…"></div>
      <div class="line">5. Can I use your jacket for the party? I will give it back tomorrow.
        <input class="inp wide" id="o12e" data-open placeholder="Your B1 sentence…"></div>
      <div class="line">6. Everyone is wearing this type of hat right now, it is very popular.
        <input class="inp wide" id="o12f" data-open placeholder="Your B1 sentence…"></div>
      <div class="line">7. I only wear relaxed clothes like jeans and T-shirts at weekends.
        <input class="inp wide" id="o12g" data-open placeholder="Your B1 sentence…"></div>
      <div class="line">8. I bought this phone yesterday, no one has used it before me.
        <input class="inp wide" id="o12h" data-open placeholder="Your B1 sentence…"></div>
      <div class="actions">
        <button class="btn primary" id="save12">Save answers</button>
        <button class="btn ghost" id="model12btn">Show model answers</button>
      </div>
      <div class="example hidden" id="model12"><b>Model answers:</b><br>
        1. My sister always wears smart clothes to work. / My sister is always well-dressed at work.<br>
        2. I don't like buying second-hand clothes.<br>
        3. These shoes are uncomfortable.<br>
        4. My blue shirt matches my black trousers.<br>
        5. Can I borrow your jacket for the party?<br>
        6. This type of hat is very trendy / fashionable right now.<br>
        7. I only wear casual clothes at weekends.<br>
        8. I bought this brand new phone yesterday.</div>
      <div class="fb" id="fb12"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="card" data-a="g">
      <div class="card-top"><span class="exnum">EX 1.3</span><h3>Context &amp; Personalization</h3><span class="badge drag">drag & drop + writing</span></div>
      <p class="instr"><b>Instructions:</b> drag the words from the box and drop them into the correct gaps in the text. Then answer the questions about YOURSELF.</p>
      
      <div class="word-bank" id="wordBank13">
        <div class="drag-word" draggable="true" data-w="trendy">trendy</div>
        <div class="drag-word" draggable="true" data-w="casual">casual</div>
        <div class="drag-word" draggable="true" data-w="loose-fitting">loose-fitting</div>
        <div class="drag-word" draggable="true" data-w="matches">matches</div>
        <div class="drag-word" draggable="true" data-w="second-hand">second-hand</div>
        <div class="drag-word" draggable="true" data-w="borrow">borrow</div>
        <div class="drag-word" draggable="true" data-w="brand new">brand new</div>
